000000\">以创建一个</span><span data-lake-id=\"ub6649b5d\" id=\"ub6649b5d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.PeftModel\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u4b895e54\" id=\"u4b895e54\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0b1feecc\" id=\"u0b1feecc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">PeftModel</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u3755ae4d\" id=\"u3755ae4d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">。要了解模型中可训练参数的数量，请使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"ud8242bb1\" id=\"ud8242bb1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u4f9fb64a\" id=\"u4f9fb64a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u053abe96\" id=\"u053abe96\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">print_trainable_parameters</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uec4f9f61\" id=\"uec4f9f61\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u14e2639e\" id=\"u14e2639e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">方法。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20peft%20import%20get_peft_model%5Cn%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20get_peft_model(model%2C%20peft_config)%5Cnmodel.print_trainable_parameters()%5Cn%5C%22output%3A%20trainable%20params%3A%202359296%20%7C%7C%20all%20params%3A%201231940608%20%7C%7C%20trainable%25%3A%200.19151053100118282%5C%22%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vOjou%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u407334a3\" id=\"u407334a3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4ddf8cfe\" id=\"u4ddf8cfe