r: #000000\">model.save_pretrained(&quot;output_dir&quot;)</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufa7d67f9\" id=\"ufa7d67f9\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf4b28153\" id=\"uf4b28153\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">您还可以使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"uaf0102d9\" id=\"uaf0102d9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/transformers/v4.49.0/en/main_classes/model#transformers.PreTrainedModel.push_to_hub\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u93e5ada2\" id=\"u93e5ada2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf877f85e\" id=\"uf877f85e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">push_to_hub</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u617c9aae\" id=\"u617c9aae\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u25ef85cd\" id=\"u25ef85cd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">函数将模型保存到 Hub（请先确保您已登录您的 Hugging Face 帐户）。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E4%BF%9D%E5%AD%98%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%5Cn%23%20%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8BID%EF%BC%8C%E5%8C%85%E5%90%AB%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E5%90%8D%E7%A7%B0%E3%80%81PEFT%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E5%92%8C%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%5Cnpeft_model_id%20%3D%20f%5C%22%7Bmodel_name_or_path%7D_%7Bpeft_config.peft_type%7D_%7Bpeft_config.task_type%7D%5C%22%5Cn%23%20%E4%BF%9D%E5%AD%98%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E5%88%B0%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%5Cnmodel.save_pretrained(peft_model_id)%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20huggingface_hub%20import%20notebook_login%5Cnnotebook_login()%5Cnmodel.push_to_hub(%5C%22your-name%2Fbigscience%2Fmt0-small-lora%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MSFD4%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uefc84bf6\" id=\"uefc84bf6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u83cbc5c0\" id=\"u83cbc5c0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">这两种方法都只保存训练的额外 PEFT 权重，这意味着存储、传输和加载都非常高效。例如，这个使用 LoRA 训练的 模型仅包含两个文件：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u1cd8cc44\" id=\"u1cd8cc44\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue2d0ff56\" id=\"ue2d0ff56\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">adapter_config.json</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub61697a8\" id=\"ub61697a8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\"> 和 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u3654e822\" id=\"u3654e822\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue5d15bb5\" id=\"ue5d15bb5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">adapter_model.safetensors</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1783304b\" id=\"u1783304b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">。</span><code data-lake-id=\"u9aa7b512\" id=\"u9aa7b512\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8a993564\" id=\"u8a993564\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">adapter_model.safetensors</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u294fbd2d\" id=\"u294fbd2d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\"> 文件仅有 1.3MB！</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc07b55f2\" id=\"uc07b55f2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3019e8ef\" id=\"u3019e8ef\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">存储在 Hub 上的 模型的适配器权重仅约 1.3MB，而完整模型权重的大小可能约为1.1GB。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"ed6f7ed8\" id=\"ed6f7ed8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u63b8b4cd\" id=\"u63b8b4cd\" style=\"color: #000000\">推理</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ucef24000\" id=\"ucef24000\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8bb1de0c\" id=\"u8bb1de0c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">请查看</span><span data-lake-id=\"u72988a3e\" id=\"u72988a3e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/package_reference/auto_class\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-